--- !u!114 &1013330248
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1013330246}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "FIRST TO THREE HEATS \xB7 LAST TRUCK RUNNING\nActual NWH truck suspension,
    tires, powertrain and dents. Drive, steer and brake before reversing. Reverse
    rams protect the engine but the rear can still be destroyed. Front, sides, roof,
    wheels, engine and chassis take different damage from genuine energetic solid
    contact. Low-speed scrapes and sustained compound contact do not repeatedly deal
    damage. No second collision impulse is added.\n\nKEEP MOVING: five seconds without
    meaningful chassis movement causes a fiery explosion. Wheelspin and vibration
    do not count. The stop clock runs only in active play. Rollovers allow a short
    physical rocking recovery using movement, then eliminate if unrecoverable. Engine
    damage reduces power, wheel damage reduces control, smoke/fire warn of severe
    failure. The last survivor wins; equal-step final eliminations draw. After the
    heat locks, survivors cannot be exploded by the stop rule.\n\nUp to four local
    humans plus named AI. Cab right stick looks independently; assigned keyboard
    mouse uses RMB look, middle click recenter. Shared-controller sticks keep a fixed
    useful view. Rear mirrors render the owning world, at a bounded update rate.
    Shared stadium view retains every competitor. Replays show recorded impacts,
    dents and breakup, never simulated new outcomes. Offline only."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
    type: 2}
